          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do your fragrances last?",
            "answer": "<p>Our eaux de parfum are composed at a high concentration for 8+ hours of wear. Longevity varies with skin type — apply to pulse points and moisturized skin for best results.</p>"
